Description: Night light and screen tint for the COSMIC desktop
 Night Light warms your screen's colors at night to cut blue light. It's an
 applet for the COSMIC desktop (Pop!_OS).
 .
 It can follow sunset and sunrise where you are, or a schedule you set, and
 can dim the screen too.
 .
 This is an unofficial community project. It isn't made or endorsed by
 System76.
